  "Ecoviz™ harnesses Cordyceps fumosorosea to biologically control a broad range of damaging insect pests for sustainable crop protection.\n\nEcoviz™ is a biological insect-control solution containing Cordyceps fumosorosea, a naturally occurring entomopathogenic fungus. It infects susceptible insect pests by attaching to their outer surface, penetrating the cuticle and multiplying within the host. Ecoviz™ helps manage whiteflies, aphids, thrips, mealybugs and other soft-bodied pests, supporting healthy crops and sustainable pest-management practices.",
  "Ecoza Ace is a neem-based botanical insecticide formulated as an emulsifiable concentrate containing 1.2% Azadirachtin derived from Azadirachta indica seed kernels. It acts primarily as an antifeedant, insect growth regulator, and repellent, interfering with the feeding, molting, and reproduction of insect pests. It is commonly used for regular pest management programs in agricultural and horticultural crops, providing effective control while maintaining a low environmental impact.",
