  "Ecoza Pro is a neem-based botanical insecticide formulated as an Emulsifiable Concentrate (EC) containing 0.3% Azadirachtin as the active ingredient derived from neem seed kernels. It acts primarily as an antifeedant, insect growth regulator, and repellent, disrupting the feeding, molting, and reproductive cycles of insect pests. Ecoza Pro is widely used for the management of sucking and chewing pests in agricultural and horticultural crops and is valued for its biodegradability, low toxicity to non-target organisms, and compatibility with Integrated Pest Management (IPM) and organic farming systems.",
  "Ecoza Rix is a neem-derived botanical insecticide formulated as a Water Soluble Powder (WSP) containing 1.2% Azadirachtin extracted from neem seed kernels. The formulation is designed to readily dissolve in water, ensuring uniform dispersion and ease of application. It functions primarily as an insect growth regulator (IGR), antifeedant, and oviposition deterrent, disrupting the hormonal balance of insect pests and thereby inhibiting their feeding, molting, and reproduction. Ecoza Rix is suitable for use in sustainable crop protection programs, integrated pest management (IPM), and environmentally responsible agricultural practices.",
