  "Humic substances improve root membrane activity and rhizosphere nutrient exchange, fulvic fractions enhance solubility and translocation of nutrients, and amino compounds directly support plant metabolism. Together they activate growth processes, improve nutrient uptake efficiency, stimulate root growth, and strengthen tolerance to abiotic stress.",
  "IGreen K is a single-nutrient biofertilizer based on the beneficial bacterium Frateuria aurantia, formulated for targeted potassium management. It mobilizes bound soil potassium from silicate minerals and clay, improving plant K uptake for stronger stalks, better yield, and enhanced quality parameters. It is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
  "IGreen N is a single-nutrient biofertilizer based on the beneficial bacterium Azotobacter chroococcum, formulated for targeted nitrogen management. It fixes atmospheric nitrogen and makes it available to the plant, reducing dependence on synthetic urea and boosting vegetative growth. It is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
  "IGreen NPK is a microbial consortium-based biofertilizer containing beneficial bacteria Bacillus polymyxa, Bacillus megaterium, and Bacillus mucilaginosus. It enhances nitrogen fixation, phosphorus solubilization, and potassium mobilization in soil. The formulation improves nutrient availability and uptake efficiency for better plant growth and yield. It also promotes root development and soil microbial activity. IGreen NPK is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
  "IGreen P is a single-nutrient biofertilizer based on the beneficial bacterium Bacillus megaterium, formulated for targeted phosphorus management. It solubilizes bound and insoluble soil phosphorus, releasing it into forms the plant can absorb — improving root development and fruit/grain formation. It is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
  "IGreen S is a single-nutrient biofertilizer based on the beneficial bacterium Thiobacillus thiooxidans, formulated for targeted sulfur management. It oxidizes elemental and reduced sulfur compounds into plant-available sulfate, essential for protein synthesis, oil formation in oilseeds, and pungency in bulb crops. It is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
  "IGreen SHIELD is a biological plant protection product formulated with a consortium of beneficial bacteria, including Bacillus licheniformis, Bacillus amyloliquefaciens, and Bacillus subtilis. It acts through antagonism, competitive colonization, and production of antimicrobial compounds to suppress a wide range of soil-borne and foliar pathogens. The formulation helps manage diseases such as Fusarium, Rhizoctonia, Alternaria, and powdery mildew. It also enhances root health, plant vigor, and natural defense mechanisms.",
  "IGreen Si is a single-nutrient biofertilizer based on the beneficial bacterium Bacillus mucilaginosus, formulated for targeted silicon management. It solubilizes silicate minerals and releases bio-available silicon, strengthening cell walls and improving plant tolerance to pests, diseases, and abiotic stresses. It is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
  "IGreen Zn is a single-nutrient biofertilizer based on the beneficial bacterium Bacillus aryabhattai, formulated for targeted zinc management. It solubilizes fixed and insoluble zinc compounds in soil, releasing plant-available Zn ions that support enzyme function, chlorophyll formation, and grain filling. It is widely used in sustainable agriculture and Integrated Nutrient Management (INM) systems.",
