  "K-Guard is a 100% natural botanical bio-acaricide derived from Pongamia glabra (Karanja). It is enriched with karanjin, a naturally occurring furano-flavonoid known for its strong acaricidal, insecticidal, and antimicrobial properties. K-Guard delivers both preventive and curative protection, effectively managing mites and a wide range of insect pests. The formulation supports sustainable crop protection programs, offering broad-spectrum pest control while maintaining a low environmental impact.",
  "K-Rix is a water-soluble powder (WSP) formulation of karanja oil developed for the effective management of sucking pests and soft-bodied insects in agricultural and horticultural crops. It functions as an antifeedant, repellent, insect growth regulator, and contact suppressant, disrupting pest feeding and development while helping to reduce pest populations. The formulation is designed to dissolve readily in water, ensuring easy tank mixing, uniform spray coverage, and consistent performance in both field and greenhouse cultivation systems.",
