  "MargoRix is a water-soluble neem oil formulation developed for the broad-spectrum management of sucking pests and soft-bodied insects in agricultural and horticultural crops. It functions as an antifeedant, repellent, insect growth regulator, and contact suppressant, disrupting pest feeding and development. The formulation is designed to readily dissolve in water, ensuring easy tank mixing, uniform spray dispersion, and reliable field performance. MargoRix offers convenient handling and consistent application under both open-field and greenhouse cultivation systems, supporting sustainable and environmentally responsible crop protection programs.",
  "MargoShine is a natural, broad-spectrum botanical insecticide, acaricide, and fungicide derived from the seeds of the Neem tree (Azadirachta indica). It acts as an antifeedant, repellent, oviposition deterrent, and insect growth regulator. MargoShine interferes with the hormonal balance of pests, preventing molting, feeding, and reproduction. Safe for beneficial insects, it provides effective pest management for sustainable and organic farming systems.",
  "MargoSpin is a synergistic bio-insecticide combining two natural actives—Neem Oil and Spinosad derived from Saccharopolyspora spinosa. Neem oil works as a repellent, antifeedant, and insect growth regulator, disrupting pest feeding and development. Spinosad targets the insect nervous system, leading to rapid feeding cessation and effective pest control. The combination provides broad-spectrum management of chewing and sucking pests in agricultural crops. This dual-action formulation enhances pest control efficacy, helps delay resistance development, and supports sustainable crop protection practices.",
  "Metarhizium WSP positioned for biological management of persistent insect populations, particularly where soil-associated stages are important.",
